pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 50]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-active
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 46, 320, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF"
  - elementId: nav-text1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>研究背景与问题</strong></p>
  - elementId: nav-text2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "#FFFFFFAA"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>难点与挑战</p>
  - elementId: nav-text3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "#FFFFFFAA"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>解决方案</p>
  - elementId: nav-text4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "#FFFFFFAA"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>技术细节与评估</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 70, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>当前研究的问题</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 115, 80, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: core-problem-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 140, 1160, 90]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$surface"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#E2E5EA"
  - elementId: core-problem-left
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 140, 5, 90]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: core-problem-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 145, 1120, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>核心问题：</strong>硬件 trace 是低层事件，而恶意软件行为声称是高层语义。如何在不把软件参考日志误报成硬件恢复结果的前提下，将低层硬件事件连接到<span style="color:$accent;"><strong>进程、可执行文件和行为标签</strong></span>？</p>
  - elementId: point1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [60, 255, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:microchip"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: point1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 250, 500, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>语义鸿沟</strong></p>
  - elementId: point1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 285, 500, 120]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>现有软件 tracing（strace、eBPF）是测量系统的一部分，存在可检测性和可绕过性问题。目标程序可通过 timing check、/proc 检测等手段发现 tracer 存在。</p>
  - elementId: point2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [660, 255, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:shield-halved"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: point2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 250, 520, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>独立观察点缺失</strong></p>
  - elementId: point2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 285, 520, 120]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>硬件 trace 提供 CPU 外部的独立观察点，目标程序无法感知或篡改。但硬件事件本身不足以支撑 malware behavior 声称，缺少归因和边界机制。</p>
  - elementId: point3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [60, 420, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:link"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: point3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 415, 1120, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>证据链断裂</strong></p>
  - elementId: point3-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 450, 1120, 50]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>需要构建一条从 <span style="color:$accent;"><strong>RTL 级提交事件 → 代码映射 → 运行时映射 → 语义行为重建</strong></span> 的可验证证据链。任何一步的混淆都会导致“看似正确”的错误声称。</p>
  - elementId: bottom-summary-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 520, 1160, 60]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: bottom-summary-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 520, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>研究本质：建立硬件 rooted 的 RISC-V 行为追踪与语义重建系统，作为对抗性场景下的独立证据来源。</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 690, 60, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>04</p>
